---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Post-signup page. The in-page signup shows the checklist link straight away; this page is the landing spot for
// joins that leave the site (no JavaScript, or a MailerLite form redirect set to this URL). Kept out of search and the sitemap.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="You're subscribed"
  description="Thanks for joining the Psychedelic Retreats Australia newsletter. Here's the retreat vetting checklist."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-medium text-forest-900 sm:text-4xl">You're subscribed. Here's your checklist.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal-soft">
      Thanks for joining. As promised, here is the Retreat Vetting Checklist: 12 questions to put to any retreat
      operator before you book, covering their legal basis, screening, facilitators and emergency planning.
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
      <li><a href="/guides/retreat-vetting-checklist-12-questions/" class="font-bold text-forest-600 underline">Read the checklist guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/tools/vetting-checklist/" class="font-bold text-forest-600 underline">Printable version (print or save as PDF)</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-6 text-charcoal-soft">
      What comes next: an occasional email when retreat laws change or we add listings and guides. If you get an email
      asking you to confirm your subscription, click the link in it. You can unsubscribe at any time.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-charcoal-soft">
      We're an independent directory, not a medical or treatment provider. Nothing here is medical advice.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
